  "content": "<div>17track 也是国内团队做的。</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/kvr7hjddic_img1.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/kvr7hjddic_img2.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>鉴于谷歌只收录了 mangoai.co 21个页面，我这边永远也打不开这个网站的页面，我有理由怀疑，不仅视频是假的，这个网站也是假的，只有首页和有限几个页面，就压根不让你打开页面。</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/kvr7hjddic_img3.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>Similarweb 上也只有三个页面。</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/kvr7hjddic_img4.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>12月流量到达了巅峰，792万。 24年1月，流量降到了379万。</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/kvr7hjddic_img5.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>95%都是品牌搜索，也说明没有内页拿到了关键词。</div>\n<div>这是他们的 Ins 页面 <a href=\"https://instagram.com/mangoai.co/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://instagram.com/mangoai.co/</a></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/kvr7hjddic_img6.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/kvr7hjddic_img7.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>他的策略是相同的视频不断发，博一个系统推荐。</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/kvr7hjddic_img8.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/kvr7hjddic_img9.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/kvr7hjddic_img10.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/kvr7hjddic_img11.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/kvr7hjddic_img12.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/kvr7hjddic_img13.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/kvr7hjddic_img14.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>大家可以跟着这个视频介绍的步骤，看看是否可以复现一下，获取 wifi 密码。 <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/CzzwASeJ6VU/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.instagram.com/p/CzzwASeJ6VU/</a></div>",
